<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰχύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make quickly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλὴν κάπετον χερσὶ ταχύνατε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1404
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς δύνασαι . . ταχύνας
				σπεῦσον κοιλὴν κάπετον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1164
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάδε τοί με σπερχόμενος
				ταχύνει</span> such are the words by which he urging
				<i>hastens</i> me, i.e. urges me to hasten, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				257
			</span></i> (lyr.):— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελὶς ταχυνομένη</span>”
				<i>quickly written,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					AP
					6.227
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>to be quick, make haste, hurry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				692
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				660
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				861
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OC</u>
				219
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				582
			</span></i>: in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.5.15
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ποιῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					18.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be early</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταχύνουσαν ἢ βραδύνουσαν ἀκμὴν
					προδιαγνῶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.201
				</span></i>
			.</div>
